Version 3.1

6/12/02  Add EDG_PRELINK_DEFAULT_OPTIONS

The environment variable EDG_PRELINK_DEFAULT_OPTIONS may now be used to
specify options to be used when invoking the prelinker.

5/23/02  Support for Microsoft C version 7

edgcc has been updated to work with the version 7 tools.  The version
7 linker no longer includes symbol information in the .exe file, so
edg_munch cannot be used.  An improved static initialization mechanism
is now used the eliminates the need for edg_munch.

edg_munch is still needed when targeting older versions of the Microsoft
compiler.  A new environment variable named EDG_MSVC_VERSION can be
used to specify that an older version is being used.  It should be
set to 6 if MSVC version 6 is being used.
